# No em dashes

Never use the em dash character (`—`) or en dash (`–`) in user-facing copy, UI strings, comments, commit messages, or documentation for this project.

Prefer commas, periods, colons, parentheses, or a normal hyphen (`-`) instead. For numeric ranges, use a hyphen with spaces: `1.2 - 1.4`.
